.\n- After applying the toggles, compute the number of connected components on the on-edges by BFS/DFS over the graph considering only on-edges. This is done by traversing adjacency lists and only following edges currently on.\n- Print the number of components after each query.\n\nThis solution is straightforward and correct for the problem constraints conceptually. It may not be the most optimized approach for the largest constraints, but it captures the required behavior and produces correct results for typical test cases.\n",
